{
    "id":  26692,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "120cm Linear LED Batten Light 36W 5CCT Linkable SMD2835 140 lm/W IP44",
    "reference":  "LN36W-5CCT-92240",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e120 cm 36W linkable linear LED batten light with 5CCT selector (2700K-3000K-4000K-5000K-6500K),\u003c/strong\u003e designed to create \u003cstrong\u003econtinuous light lines, straight or at 90° angles,\u003c/strong\u003e thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003e180° rotating connector\u003c/strong\u003e. Equipped with high-efficiency SMD2835 LEDs (140 lm/W), a 180° beam angle and IP44 protection, it delivers uniform, low-consumption lighting. Its sleek, minimalist design makes it ideal for offices, retail spaces, kitchens and any area requiring professional linear LED lighting.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eLinkable Linear LED Batten Light 120 cm 36W | Selectable 5CCT | 140 lm/W | 180° Rotating Connector | IP44\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003e120 cm 36W Linkable Linear LED Batten Light\u003c/strong\u003e is a \u003cstrong\u003eprofessional linear lighting\u003c/strong\u003e solution designed to create continuous light lines with a modern, uniform and elegant finish. Thanks to its \u003cstrong\u003e5CCT selector (2700K-3000K-4000K-5000K-6500K)\u003c/strong\u003e, you can easily choose the most suitable colour temperature for each project, offering great versatility in both commercial and residential installations.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEquipped with \u003cstrong\u003ehigh-efficiency SMD2835 LEDs (140 lm/W)\u003c/strong\u003e, it delivers powerful, homogeneous lighting with reduced consumption, contributing to energy savings and lower maintenance costs. Its \u003cstrong\u003e180° beam angle\u003c/strong\u003e ensures excellent light distribution, eliminating shadows and providing a high level of visual comfort.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne of its main benefits is its \u003cstrong\u003elinkable\u003c/strong\u003e system, which allows several batten lights to be joined together to create \u003cstrong\u003econtinuous light lines\u003c/strong\u003e. It also features an innovative \u003cstrong\u003e180° rotating connector\u003c/strong\u003e with male and female connectors, making installation easy both in a straight line and at \u003cstrong\u003e90° angles\u003c/strong\u003e, offering great flexibility to adapt to the layout of any space without the need for complex accessories.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts \u003cstrong\u003eminimalist, elegant design\u003c/strong\u003e, together with \u003cstrong\u003eIP44 protection\u003c/strong\u003e, makes it an excellent choice for indoor installations requiring resistance to dust and occasional splashes, while maintaining a clean, professional look.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRecommended uses and applications\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIdeal for LED lighting projects in:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eOffices and workspaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eShops and retail spaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eKitchens\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCorridors and transit areas\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEducational centres\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eHotels and hospitality spaces\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCommercial premises\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eContinuous indoor linear lighting\u003c/strong\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn short, the \u003cstrong\u003e120 cm 36W 5CCT Linkable Linear LED Batten Light\u003c/strong\u003e offers a versatile, efficient and easy-to-install solution for linear lighting projects. Its \u003cstrong\u003e5CCT selector\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e140 lm/W SMD2835 LEDs\u003c/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e180° rotating connector\u003c/strong\u003e for straight or \u003cstrong\u003e90°\u003c/strong\u003e configurations and \u003cstrong\u003eIP44 protection\u003c/strong\u003e guarantee uniform lighting, lower energy consumption and an excellent \u003cstrong\u003ereturn on investment (ROI)\u003c/strong\u003e in any professional installation.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\n\n\u003c/p\u003e",
